'''Gilgamesh''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel]] collaboration gacha event. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 368
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Gilgamesh
|name2 = Gilgamesh CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gilgamesh CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Gilgamesh can be used in much the same way as [[Splendid Ganesha (Uber Rare Cat)|Splendid Ganesha]], except with two notable differences. The first is that Gilgamesh has lower DPS due to Ganesha's higher attack percentage increase. The second is that Gilgamesh performs multi-hit attacks, dividing his damage into three equal parts.

Since his multiple hits are grouped so tightly, Gilgamesh has no chance of hitting a target with all three hits if they are knocked back. For the same reason, enemies are unlikely to move into his attack range between his first and last hit. As a result, Gilgamesh's effective DPS will be only 42~83% of Ganesha's against some enemies, rendering his multi-hit quirk far more of a curse than a blessing. Unfortunately, his small inner range does not help his case.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper}}

